  "limitations": [
    "Validated execution covers barcode-filtered MACS3 FRAG peak calling, supplied-sequence motif matching, chromVAR backgrounds/deviations, and paired-cell Signac LinkPeaks. The public PBMC1k ATAC case independently validates real 10x fragments, filtered-cell accounting, and MACS3 peak calling only; motifmatchr, chromVAR, and Signac LinkPeaks remain covered by the complete executable fixture because the ATAC-only public source has no paired RNA or declared motif/sequence resource. The module does not establish direct transcription-factor binding or causal peak-gene regulation, replace donor-level differential accessibility, or infer missing RNA. Execution requires a compatible project-approved scientific runtime."
  ],
